OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers this
OL,6,Fevening will gradually become confined
OL,7,Fto northern counties overnight.
OL,8,FElsewhere it will become dry overnight
OL,9,Fwith clear periods. Fresh
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds easing down.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMostly dry with variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud and some sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Chance of a light shower
OL,15,Facross the north at first.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,18,Fstart on Thursday before rain spreads
OL,19,Feast for a time, drier later. Dry with
OL,20,Fsunny spells on Friday. Rain likely on
OL,21,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
